1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,600
One missing manuscript.
Everyone has a theory.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:08,000
Look closer.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Cluenite is a mystery game for streamers
and their Twitch chat.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Try a Practice Case with scripted chat.
Search the room and follow the clues.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,500
The first theory points to the gardener.

6
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:30,000
One small problem: the windowsill was dry.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
The key was signed out from 20:50 to 21:02.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
The clock stopped at 20:52.
Connect the records to test the alibi.

9
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Put the evening in order.
Does the timeline support the story?

10
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,000
The theft: 20:52. The alarm: 21:05.
Thirteen minutes apart.

11
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Challenge the locked-study claim
with the key register.

12
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Who is your suspect?
Back the accusation with evidence.

13
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:09,000
Reconstruct the night.
The alarm was her alibi.

14
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Ada had the key before the alarm was raised.

15
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:18,000
The manuscript was sewn into
the lining of her coat.

16
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:21,333
Quick Case: short cases and fast deductions.

17
00:01:21,333 --> 00:01:24,667
Mystery Live: explore and rebuild the timeline.

18
00:01:24,667 --> 00:01:28,000
Co-op: two stations, one shared conclusion.

19
00:01:28,000 --> 00:02:08,000
Reserved for one real Twitch and gameplay run.
Final recording pending; this slot is empty.

20
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:13,633
We used Codex to turn case rules
into a deterministic engine.

21
00:02:13,633 --> 00:02:19,067
A correct guess still needs
the required evidence.

22
00:02:19,067 --> 00:02:24,533
EventSub validates Twitch input
before it reaches the live round.

23
00:02:24,533 --> 00:02:28,000
Running the actual evidence-engine tests.

24
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:35,000
10 engine tests passed across 3 files.
Actual source and test recording.

25
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:45,000
CLUENITE
Every clue brings us closer to the truth.
